AUDIO: 'up, high-fiving each other, looking at the Blackmagic camera like, "What is this thing?" Then we can see the announcer on the field talking to the camera. We\'ve got the left field close to the dugout. We could see home plate. Then other times we\'re transported to the other side of the field. We\'re out'

