VISUAL: The man is wearing the VR headset, gesturing with both hands.
AUDIO: 'in the outfield looking all the way across to home base. We\'re up in the stands with all of the fans checking out Yankee Stadium like, "Wow, this place is so beautiful." The graphics are amazing. We can see the starting lineup right here on the field for both the Yankees'

